AutoUpgrade New Features :
Install Oracle Home on New Server

You can use AutoUpgrade to install an Oracle Home on a New Server

Pre-requisities
1. Install required RPMs for Oracle Installation as 'root' user
oracle-database-preinstall-19c and java-1.8.0-openjdk which is required to run autoupgrade.jar using java

