*****************************************************************************************************************
4. Oracle released Release Update 19.32 in July 2026, and this is the version we will download and install. Release Updates and associated patches can be acquired through Oracle’s AutoUpgrade tool. To use AutoUpgrade, ensure that you download the most recent autoupgrade.jar from Oracle. The following steps describe the process.

(a). Download latest AutoUpdate.jar file

